## §4.1.1–4.1.2: *Enyphanie* ($E\nu$), *Protyposis* & The *Generative* {.smaller}

<div class="stratum-badge badge-d">LEVEL III FIELD DYNAMICS &amp; STRATUM D (SM, PP. 62–67, EQ. 14)</div>

:::: {.columns}

::: {.column width="48%"}
### Awakening the Colimit: *Enyphanie* ($E\nu$) & $g_E$
* Chapters 1–3 constructed static colimit networks, but a colimit diagram is kinematically frozen: it contains no internal clock, energetic gradient, or spontaneous evolution.
* In §4.0 (SM, p. 62), Heim introduces **Enyphanie ($E\nu$)**: the intrinsic, structural *Möglichkeit zur Veränderung* (latent capacity for transformation) across three scales:
  1. **Autonomous Phase Evolution:** $\mathcal{S}_m \to \mathcal{S}_{m+1}$ sublating internal antinomies.
  2. **Interactive Coupling Readiness:** Unsaturated correlation valencies ($K_m, K_s$).
  3. **Holistic Field Emergence:** Non-additive *Holoformen* ($\Delta_{\mathrm{emerg}}^{\mathcal{I}} > 0$).
* Measured by the scalar **Enyphaniegrad ($g_E$)**—compared by Heim to thermodynamic **free energy** (*freie Energie*).

::: {.thm-box .fragment}
**The *Protyposis* & *Generative* Blueprint ($\Ggen$, SM Eq. 14, p. 64):**
$$
\Ggen \equiv \left[ \left. \begin{matrix} 4 \\ \mathrm{P}_i \\ 1 \end{matrix} \right| ,\; \left. \begin{matrix} Q \\ \{ \}_{(j)} \\ 1 \end{matrix} \right| \right]_{(A, S)} \tag{SM-14}
$$
Unites the 4 elementary stores ($\mathrm{P}_i$, *Syntrixspeicher*) with $Q$ concentric rules (*Korporatorsimplex*) to generate the 4-dimensional **Syntrixtotalität ($T0$)**.
:::

:::

