## §4.2.2–4.2.4: Slice Topos $T0$, Corner Flows & BRST Cohomology {.smaller}

<div class="stratum-badge badge-a">STRATUM A: SLICE EQUIVALENCE (THM. 4.6), CORNER FLOWS (DEF. 4.7) &amp; BRST (PROP. 4.9)</div>

:::: {.columns}

::: {.column width="48%"}

::: {.thm-box}
**Def. 4.5 & Theorem 4.6: Slice-Site Topos Equivalence for $T0$**
The 4-store Generative blueprint $\Ggen$ induces the 12D carrier $P^{\UG} \coloneqq \bigoplus_{i=1}^4 P_i \cong (\mathbb{R}^{12}, \|\cdot\|_{\ell^1})$ (maintaining a strict 3-way separation between algebraic carrier $P^{\UG}$, base manifold $M_{\UG}$, and dynamical space $\Msyn \subseteq M_{\UG}$). By subcanonicity of $\Jsyn$:
$$
\mathbf{Sh}\big(\mathbf{Ctx}_{/\UG}, J_{/\UG}\big) \;\simeq\; \Esyn / \mathbf{y}(\UG)
$$
:::

<div class="interactive-panel" style="margin-top:8px;">
