#### Interactive 4-Tab Inspector: Yang–Mills & Graded BRST Complex (Prop. 4.9)

<p class="widget-context-note">
  <b>Context (§4.2.4, Def. 4.8, Prop. 4.9 &amp; Fig. 4.5):</b> Click each tab to inspect the Euclidean Yang–Mills functional, the ghost-number-graded configuration algebra $\Fext = \bigoplus_{g\in\mathbb{Z}} \mathcal{F}^g$, the algebraic proof of $s_{\mathrm{BRST}}^2 \equiv 0$, and physical cohomology $H^0_{\mathrm{BRST}}$.
</p>
