## §4.3.1–4.3.3: Hodge–Laplacian Splitting, Atiyah Algebroid & Bogomolny Bound {.smaller}

<div class="stratum-badge badge-b">STRATUM B: ELLIPTIC SPLITTING (THM. 4.11), EMERGENCE (DEF. 4.13) &amp; BOGOMOLNY BOUND (THMS. 4.14–4.15)</div>

:::: {.columns}

::: {.column width="48%"}

::: {.thm-box}
**Theorem 4.11 ($c_{\mathrm{LAPLACE}}$): 2-Way Fredholm Laplacian Splitting (Fig. 4.7)**
For $\Delta_{A_0} \coloneqq D_{A_0}D_{A_0}^* + D_{A_0}^* D_{A_0}$ on compact boundaryless $M_U$, $L^2\Omega^2 = \im(\Delta_{A_0}) \oplus_{L^2} \mathcal{H}_{\Delta_{A_0}}^2$ ($\Phi_{\mathrm{int}} = G_{A_0}\Omegaint$):
$$
\Omegaint = \Delta_{A_0}\Phi_{\mathrm{int}} + \gamma_{\mathrm{harm}} \implies \mathcal{E}_{\mathrm{int}}^{\mathcal{D}} = \frac{1}{2}\Big(\|\Delta_{A_0}\Phi_{\mathrm{int}}\|_{L^2}^2 + \|\gamma_{\mathrm{harm}}\|_{L^2}^2\Big)
$$
(3-way splitting $\im D_{A_0} \oplus \im D_{A_0}^* \oplus \mathcal{H}_{A_0}^2$ holds iff $D_{A_0}^2 = 0$).
:::

::: {.carnap-box .fragment}
**Def. 4.13 ($\Delta_{\mathrm{emerg}}^{\mathcal{I}}$), Thm. 4.14 ($\At(P_U)$) & Thm. 4.15 (Bogomolny):**
1. **Background-Normalized Emergence Functional (Fig. 4.8):**
$$
\Delta_{\mathrm{emerg}}^{\mathcal{I}}(\Gamma; \mathcal{D}) \;\coloneqq\; \mathcal{I}(\mathbf{A}) - \sum_{k=1}^N \mathcal{I}(A_0 + a_k) + (N - 1)\mathcal{I}(A_0)
$$
2. **Atiyah Exact Sequence:** $0 \to \ad P_U \xrightarrow{\iota} \At(P_U) \xrightarrow{d\pi_U} TM_U \to 0$, with curvature as bracket obstruction $\iota F_A(X,Y) = [\sigma_{\mathbf{A}}X, \sigma_{\mathbf{A}}Y] - \sigma_{\mathbf{A}}[X,Y]$.
3. **Chern–Weil Topological Stability Bound (Fig. 4.4):** For instanton charge $Q_{\mathrm{top}}(\mathbf{A}) \coloneqq \frac{1}{8\pi^2}\int_{M_4}\langle F_A \wedge F_A\rangle_{\mathfrak{g}} \in \mathbb{Z}\setminus\{0\}$:
$$
\mathcal{I}(\mathbf{A}) \;\ge\; 4\pi^2 \big|Q_{\mathrm{top}}(\mathbf{A})\big|, \qquad \Delta_{\mathrm{emerg}}^{\mathcal{I}}(\Gamma; \mathcal{D}) \;>\; 0
$$
:::

:::

