## §4.4–4.6: Reconstruction Map $\mathcal{R}$, Sanity Checks & Synthesis {.smaller}

<div class="stratum-badge badge-c">STRATUM C: EXPLICATION 4.1, MASTER REGISTER (SM EQS. 14–19a) &amp; BRIDGE TO CH. 5</div>

:::: {.columns}

::: {.column width="54%"}

| Heimian Concept ($\mathbf{D}$) | Mathematical Explicatum ($\mathcal{R}$ in $\mathbf{A}/\mathbf{B}$) | Status & Ref. |
|:---|:---|:---:|
| **Enyphanie ($E\nu$)** | Interaction curvature 2-form $\Omegaint \in \Omega^2(M_U, \ad P_U)$ | **B-Thm** (Thm. 4.10) |
| **Enyphaniegrad ($g_E$)** | Gauge-invariant density $g_E^{\mathcal{D}}(x) = \frac{1}{2}\|\Omegaint\|_{g_U, \mathfrak{g}}^2$ | **B-Def** (Def. 4.16) |
| **Generative ($\Ggen$, Eq. 14)** | Blueprint inducing $\UG \in \Ctx$ ($P^{\UG} \cong \mathbb{R}^{12}$) | **A-Def** (Def. 4.5) |
| **Syntrixtotalität ($T0$)** | Slice topos $\mathbf{Sh}(\mathbf{Ctx}_{/\UG}, J_{/\UG}) \simeq \Esyn / \mathbf{y}(\UG)$ | **A-Thm** (Thm. 4.6) |
| **Enyphane ($\mathcal{E}, \mathcal{E}^{-1}$, Eqs. 16–17)** | Complete corner flow $\Phi_t^X \in \operatorname{Diff}(\mathcal{M})$ ($(\Phi_t^X)^{-1} = \Phi_{-t}^X$) | **A-Def** (Def. 4.7) |
| **Holoform ($\mathbf{H}$)** | Section $\Gamma \in \Match(\mathbf{P})$ with $\Delta_{\mathrm{emerg}}^{\mathcal{I}}(\Gamma; \mathcal{D}) > 0$ | **B-Def** (Def. 4.13) |
| **Syntrixfeld ($\Fsyn$)** | Geometric triple $(\Msyn, \gsyn, \Xkor)$ | **B-Def** (Def. 4.17) |
| **Syntrixfunktor & Zeitkorn (Eq. 18)** | Pushout $\YF$ & $\delta t_n = \tau(n+1)-\tau(n)$ | **B-Def** (Defs. 4.19–20) |
| **Matrix $\hat{A}$ & Affinity (Eq. 19)** | $3 \times 3$ grid ($A_{12}, A_{22}$ singular) & bilinear $\beta^\infty$ | **B-Thm** (Thm. 4.22) |

::: {.thm-box .fragment}
